WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.162
Documented CFNIS Pattern: Retaliation Against Reporters.

00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:13.937
A table of cases from public records showing MPCC complaints, court decisions, and ombudsman findings that establish a pattern.

00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:23.175
When military personnel report wrongdoing, the investigative apparatus retaliates against the reporter instead of pursuing the reported misconduct.
